{"id":"65a801e1cd7a04f9cb74367f","slug":"the-grand-opening-of-leo-ristorante-bar","lang":"en","title":"The Grand Opening of Leo Ristorante & Bar","subtitle":"LEO Opening Party: Thursday, March 17, from 5:00 p.m\nAbove the rooftops of Zurich's Bahnhofstrasse, Ristorante LEO brings you closer to the Italian way of life day by day.","date":"2022-03-17T08:12:00.000Z","category":"Gastronomy","categorySlug":"gastronomy","author":"Federica Lupinu","authorPhoto":"https://media.italians.ch/img/5f97fd6ecef66b9c2a82dc1d_Federica_Lupinu_1.jpg","authorRole":"Reporter","tags":["Leo Restaurant & Bar in Zurich","Italian Restaurant","Rooftop Restaurant in Zurich"],"image":"https://media.italians.ch/img/6232eeb80c6d9afba1c10fd7_LEO-Ristorante-Bar-Zurich9-c.jpg","thumb":"https://media.italians.ch/img/6232eeb80c6d9afba1c10fd7_LEO-Ristorante-Bar-Zurich9-c.jpg","gallery":["https://media.italians.ch/img/6232eeb80c6d9afba1c10fd7_LEO-Ristorante-Bar-Zurich9.jpg","https://media.italians.ch/img/6232eeb84998eba48a2cc795_LEO-Ristorante-Bar-Zurich15.jpeg","https://media.italians.ch/img/6232eed119a8da104b08a10e_LEO-Ristorante-Bar-Zurich1.jpg","https://media.italians.ch/img/6232eed123e7061b4ec73c48_LEO-Ristorante-Bar-Zurich2.jpg","https://media.italians.ch/img/6232eed13ee2eab0ab10450b_LEO-Ristorante-Bar-Zurich12.jpg","https://media.italians.ch/img/6232eed1e9856d9e6ca69c7e_LEO-Ristorante-Bar-Zurich11.jpg","https://media.italians.ch/img/6232eed145782599d3440bbc_LEO-Ristorante-Bar-Zurich13.jpg","https://media.italians.ch/img/6232eed10c6d9a0a3bc11053_LEO-Ristorante-Bar-Zurich10.jpg","https://media.italians.ch/img/6232eed053a65683415c352b_LEO-Ristorante-Bar-Zurich14.jpg","https://media.italians.ch/img/6232eed0e9856d4671a69c79_LEO-Ristorante-Bar-Zurich16.jpg","https://media.italians.ch/img/6232eed01624c903c51bb5ec_LEO-Ristorante-Bar-Zurich18.jpg","https://media.italians.ch/img/6232eed08d539e70910ef897_LEO-Ristorante-Bar-Zurich19.jpg","https://media.italians.ch/img/6232eed093c57f20bac9a78d_LEO-Ristorante-Bar-Zurich20.jpg","https://media.italians.ch/img/6232eed0d8d3196476910c29_LEO-Ristorante-Bar-Zurich21.jpg","https://media.italians.ch/img/6232eed0fe83a65dca4259c3_LEO-Ristorante-Bar-Zurich22.jpg","https://media.italians.ch/img/6232eed0a450646069b3c6f3_LEO-Ristorante-Bar-Zurich24.jpg"],"body":"<p>WELCOME TO LEO! The Grand Opening of Leo Ristorante &amp; Bar is in full swing this evening If you are looking for la Dolce Vita, you don't have to travel far. Passion, authenticity and hospitality - just as we know Italy – discover it now at LEO, the new restaurant on the 5th floor at Globus Zurich Bahnhofstrasse. From morning to night, the restaurant spoils its guests with true classics, such as antipasti, homemade pasta and grilled specialties, accompanied by a wide selection of wines and cocktails from all regions of Italy.</p><h5>LEO Opening Party: Thursday, March 17, from 5:00 p.m</h5><p>If you are out and about this evening, come by and enjoy a cocktail above the rooftops of Zurich. We are open until 2am tonight with a live band, DJ and other fun surprises to round up the celebrations. We are looking forward to your visit!</p><h5>The Team</h5><figure class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image w-richtext-align-center\" data-rt-type=\"image\" data-rt-align=\"center\"><div><img alt=\"LEO Geschäftsführerin JILL GERBER\" src=\"https://media.italians.ch/img/6232ea0b3eb42f07b8c8460f_Jill-Gerber-LEO-Z-rich.jpg\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><figcaption>Manager JILL GERBER</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image w-richtext-align-center\" data-rt-type=\"image\" data-rt-align=\"center\"><div><img alt=\"LEO Küchenchef DOMENICO AMATO\" src=\"https://media.italians.ch/img/6232ea2ffb680825bda200c7_Domenico-Amato-LEO-Z-rich.jpg\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><figcaption>Chef DOMENICO AMATO</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image w-richtext-align-center\" data-rt-type=\"image\" data-rt-align=\"center\"><div><img alt=\"LEO Chef de Bar DAMIR DJOKOVIC\" src=\"https://media.italians.ch/img/6232ea9808b7120783e811de_Damir-Djokovic-LEO-Z-rich.jpg\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><figcaption>Chef de Bar DAMIR DJOKOVIC</figcaption></figure><p><strong>LEO Ristorante &amp; Bar</strong><br>Rooftop Globus<br>Schweizergrasse 11<br>8001 Zurich<a href=\"tel:+4144-504-83-84\"><br>Tel. 044 504 83 84</a></p><p>OPENING HOURS<br>Monday - Wednesday / 11 a.m. - 12 p.m. (warm dishes until 10 p.m.)<br>Thursday - Saturday / 11 a.m. - 2 a.m. (warm dishes until 10.30 p.m.)<br>Sunday / 11 a.m.- 7 p.m.<a href=\"http://www.ristorante-leo.ch\" target=\"_blank\"><br>www.ristorante-leo.ch</a></p>","videoLink":null,"versions":{"it":"grande-apertura-di-leo-ristorante-bar-a-zurigo","de":"grand-opening-von-leo-ristorante-bar-in-zurich"}}